<Base title="Privacy" description="What Hoarding Cleanup Finder collects and how it is used.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>We collect what you type into a form (name, email, phone, ZIP, message) and standard server logs. Quote requests are passed to the cleanup companies you chose or that serve your area, and kept so we can follow up. Company accounts store an email address and, for featured listings, a Stripe customer reference; card details are held by Stripe, not by us. We use Cloudflare Turnstile to block automated submissions. We do not run advertising trackers. To have your data deleted, email <a href="mailto:hello@hoardingcleanupfinder.com">hello@hoardingcleanupfinder.com</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
